  "description": "We love a good glaze for a superstar protein, so tonight’s tender haloumi gets tossed in an oregano, lemon and honey glaze, adding just the right amount of herb to sweetness ratio. Paired with garlic-chilli spiked veggies and some flaked almonds for some extra crunch, this one is a real textural treat!\nThis recipe is under 650kcal per serving and under 40g carbohydrates per serving.",
